{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お爪様がオレンジ色。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわぼさぼさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日に当たってる髪の毛は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに茶色く見えるのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいか！おまえら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいって言わせてやるからなあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は撮影がありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近何時に寝る？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"0時過ぎちゃう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにか楽器とかできるー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピアノはねこふんじゃったまで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベースはパパにちょっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてもらったからほんのちょっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっかりみさ先輩が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定着していますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めに言ったのまりかでしたよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩、姉さんぽいから笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみにねねころって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あだ名もわたしが考えたんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかの疲れ解消法とは!?\n高３によく効く解消法"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてください(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず寝る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休憩の合間にちょっとでも寝る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時期の暑いとき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"扇風機で過ごす？エアコンつける？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとも窓開けるだけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"窓開けて涼んでるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏の風物詩ってなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣！なす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷やし中華好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざるそば？そうめん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部すきだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも麺類で特にすきなのはそばだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華ちゃんに一般生活で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出会ったらどう対応してほしいですか。\nひめたんは、あんまし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プライベートすぎる空気なら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと察してほしいって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうですね。うーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめかと同じくかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はどんな服買った？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"marble SUDでブローチと靴下"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴下今日履いた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかの雨の日スタイルは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じめじめして暑いときは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな髪型をしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かさばらない服装。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子とか三つ編みは楽よー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で前回の乃木どこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いなかったのー？(´･ω･`;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学業で..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今週も欠席です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲の振り付けやりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く夏休みになれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/20/3688343/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日限り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さよならオレンジ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}